code#doctor
title# My API Docs

hero# API Reference
 desc# Everything you need to integrate with our API.

h2# Authentication

p# All requests require a **Bearer token** in the Authorization header.

code#bash
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
     https://api.example.com/v1/users
end#

alert#warning
 p# Keep your tokens secure. Never commit them to version control.

h2# Endpoints

table# Method | Endpoint | Description
 GET | /users | List all users
 POST | /users | Create a new user
 GET | /users/:id | Get a specific user
 DELETE | /users/:id | Delete a user
end#
end#

h2# Features

grid#3
card# Zero Dependencies
 desc# The compiler is a single Python file with no external packages.
card# Dark Mode
 desc# Automatically respects the user's system preference.
card# Responsive
 desc# Sidebar collapses on mobile. Tables scroll horizontally.
end#

divider#

p# Ready to start? Fork this repo and edit `docs/index.doctor` to write your own documentation.
